WEBVTT

NOTE
A desert settlement is struck by missiles. Aerial view of the town, then it erupts in a massive explosion.

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
Aerial view of a small settlement clustered around rock in the desert.

00:03.000 --> 00:07.000
A fireball engulfs the town. A mushroom cloud billows upward from the wreckage.
